Copied unchanged; every later change listed below with its test.

Built outside the bellwether workspace:
- crates/vendor/Cargo.toml is its workspace. It repeats the
  [workspace.package] and [workspace.dependencies] of Flockbook's
  xplat/Cargo.toml, which this manifest reads with `*.workspace = true`.
- crates/vendor/Cargo.lock started as Flockbook's xplat/Cargo.lock at
  the same commit; cargo kept only this crate's packages, at the same
  versions.
- The root workspace excludes crates/vendor because this code is not
  rustfmt-formatted and fails clippy -D warnings on Rust 1.99.1
  (redundant_guard, unnecessary_map_or, needless_lifetimes,
  collapsible_match, int_plus_one, type_complexity). Its tests run in
  scripts/test.sh.
- tests/common/mod.rs and tests/parser.rs read fixtures from
  ../../Tests/HerdrKitTests/Fixtures. The 14 files they use are copied
  unchanged from Flockbook's Tests/HerdrKitTests/Fixtures to
  crates/Tests/HerdrKitTests/Fixtures (the hub/ folder is not used).

